#subtitle: The state government of Hamburg is a bulwark of the left...

= Hamburg Affairs

Hamburg is a stronghold of the left in Germany, and we intend to keep it that way.

We can enact policies in Hamburg.

- @build_ties: We can use push our state party to strengthen ties with the other local parties.
- @pursue_policy: We can push our state party to pursue policy goals on the local level.
- @paramilitary: We can pursue policies regarding the local paramilitaries.
- @root: No new policies are needed.
- @easy_discard

@build_ties

- @build_ties_ddp: Push our state party to strengthen ties with the state DDP.
- @build_ties_uspd: Push our state party to strenghten ties with the state USPD.

@pursue_policy

- @bureaucracy: Purge the bureaucracy of reactionary elements.

@paramilitary

- @persecute_sa: Use our state offices to target and prosecute the state SA.
- @persecute_rfb: Use our state offices to target and prosecute the state RFB.
- @persecute_sh: Use our state offices to target and prosecute the state Stalhelm.
- @recruit_rsb: Use our state offices to promote recruitment for the Reichsbanner.

@build_ties_ddp
on-arrival: ddp_relation += 5

Our state party, at our request, seeks to strengthen ties with the state DDP. We can only hope these efforts will become felt at the federal level too.

@build_ties_uspd
on-arrival: uspd_relation += 5

Our state party, at our request, seeks to strengthen ties with the state USPD. We can only hope these efforts will become felt at the federal level too.

@bureaucracy
on-arrival: hamburg_nsdap -= 0.02 if hamburg_nsdap >= 0.6; hamburg_nsdap -= 0.02 if year < 1930 and hamburg_nsdap >= 0.6; hamburg_dnvp += 0.02 if year < 1930 and hamburg_dnvp < 1.2; hamburg_dnvp -= 0.03 if year >= 1930 and hamburg_dnvp >= 0.8; hamburg_other += 0.02 if year >= 1930 and hamburg_other < 1.2; hamburg_dvp += 0.01 if year >= 1930; nationalism -= 5; pacifism += 1; democratization += 1; pro_republic += 3*(1-dissent); new_middle_spd += 2*(1-dissent) if democratization >= 3; new_middle_spd += 2*(1-dissent) if democratization >= 4; coup_progress += 0.5

The bureaucracy is deeply reactionary, and many abuse their power to favor the political right. By removing the pro-monarchy and pro-dictatorship elements, we can democratize it. Some of our opponents claim that we are infringing on individual freedoms, but perhaps the security of the republic requires it.

@persecute_sa 
on-arrival: sa_strength -= 500; uspd_relation += 3

As it turns out, the Nazi SA has many allies in the police and bureaucracy, undermining our efforts. Nevertheless, the SA is substantially weakened by our efforts.

@persecute_sh 
on-arrival: sa_strength -= 250; dvp_relation -= 5; uspd_relation += 3

Unsurprisingly, the Stalhelm has many allies in the police and bureaucracy, undermining our efforts. Nevertheless, our efforts bear some fruit.

@persecute_rfb 
on-arrival: rfb_strength -= 1000; uspd_relation -= 10; z_relation += 3; dvp_relation += 3

The reactionary elements in the police and bureaucracy enthusiastically carry out these orders – rather more enthusiastically than we’d like, in fact. Nevertheless, our efforts bear clear fruit.

@recruit_rsb
On-arrival: rb_strength += 250; rb_militancy += 0.05; z_relation -= 2; dvp_relation -= 3

We have used our state offices to promote recruitment to the Reichsbanner. The other state parties decry this as an abuse of office, but we ignore their protests.
